  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changing the World One Bedside at a Time</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Palliative Care addresses health related suffering and is an essential primary health care service. IAHPC provides educational resources to  our members  to help them support their patients who are suffering. They also need to educate their policymakers and the public about palliative care. Advocacy is strongest when it includes the voices of those who deliver and those who receive palliative care. Few such resources exist to support palliative care advocacy or clinical care.</narrative>
  </description>
